OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service leadership
OL,4,Ajudged to have improved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leadership at an ambulance service
OL,7,Fthat covers 4.4 million people across
OL,8,Fthe south of England has progressed but
OL,9,Fstill requires improvement, an industry
OL,10,Fwatchdog has found.
OL,12,FSouth Central Ambulance Service NHS
OL,13,FFoundation Trust (SCAS) had previously
OL,14,Fbeen rated as inadequate in terms of
OL,15,Fleadership by the Care Quality
OL,16,FCommission (CQC).
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
