OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance service leadership
OL,4,Ajudged to have improved
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut following an inspection earlier
OL,7,Fthis year, the CQC has upgraded that
OL,8,Fscore to requires improvement -
OL,9,Fpraising the "more stable leadership
OL,10,Fteam" now in place at the ambulance
OL,11,Fservice.
OL,13,FSCAS chief executive Simon Ashton said
OL,14,Fthe report "paints the picture of an
OL,15,Forganisation that has worked hard to
OL,16,Frecover, stabilise and improve".
